  "description": "Branded by a devious creature so that she can’t hold back her desires, excommunicated former priestess Charlotte trades her holy robes for a maid’s uniform. However, things get complicated when she navigates the eccentric needs of her masters. From curing a Duke’s trauma to triggering the overdue \"heat\" of royal wolf-knights, Charlotte’s competence and her awakening desires keep landing her in scandalous trouble. Caught between her sacred past and a carnal future, this maid must decide if she’ll maintain her “purity” or finally embrace the ecstasy of the fall.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
